Package: nasc
Title: Network-Aware Synthetic Control Estimator
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Frederik", "von Waldow", , "f.vonwaldow@uni-bonn.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment =c(ORCID = "0009-0009-4269-2088"))
Description: Implements Bayesian Network-Aware Synthetic Control (NASC) estimators
    for causal inference in panel data settings. Provides tools for estimating
    treatment effects under spillovers and spatial dependence using Stan-based MCMC
    sampling, with support for single and multiple treated units, covariate
    adjustment, predictor matching, and network weight matrices.
